# Agentic Workflow Rules

## Task Tracking
- Reference `TODOS.md` at project root for current tasks
- Update task status when completing work
- Add new tasks as they're identified

## Documentation Updates
When completing significant work:
1. Mark task complete in `TODOS.md`
2. Add changelog entry in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`
3. If architectural decision was made, add ADR to `docs/DECISIONS.md`

## Before Starting Work
1. Check `TODOS.md` for context on current priorities
2. Review relevant docs in `/docs` for domain knowledge
3. Check for existing patterns in codebase

## After Completing Work
1. Update `TODOS.md` with completed items
2. Note any new issues discovered
3. Document any decisions made

## Commit Messages
Follow conventional commits:
- `feat(scope): description` - New features
- `fix(scope): description` - Bug fixes
- `refactor(scope): description` - Code refactoring
- `docs(scope): description` - Documentation
- No period at end, max 100 chars in header
